It seems almost any example I put into <a href="http://rise4fun.com/SpecSharp" rel="nofollow">http://rise4fun.com/SpecSharp</a> results in a message<br />
<pre><code>   Unhandled Exception:
       Cannot print exception string because Exception.ToString() failed.</code></pre>

For example the following program causes this problem<br />
<pre><code>class Example {
  int x;

  int Inc()
    ensures old(x) &lt; result;
  {
    x += 1;
    return x ;
  }
}</code></pre>

as does<br />
<pre><code>class Example {

}</code></pre>
